    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 28-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 dielectric stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2. Initialize thicknesses from iteration_14 best candidate (candidate HfO2_SiO2_28layer_opt__gradient_thickness__01). Apply ±15% uniform random perturbation exclusively to layers with thickness <70 nm. Use gradient_thickness optimizer. Evaluate at normal incidence, unpolarized. Maximize mean transmittance in 1000-1700 nm band and mean reflectance in 300-450 nm band. Temporarily relax tightest_margin constraint by 0.02 to target valid_candidates >= 15. Total layer count fixed at 28. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 300-450 nm, 1000-1700 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1000-1700 nm; high reflection in 300-450 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: low transmission in 300-450 nm; low reflection in 1000-1700 nm. manufacturing constraints: total layer count <= 30; materials restricted to HfO2 and SiO2.",
